{"id":"00061","root":"uni00061_1","name":{"ja":"ドナ・バロウズ","en":"Donna Burroughs"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ドナ・バロウズ","en":"Donna Burroughs"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-11-30","limited":false,"characterId":54,"profile":{"ja":"米連の対魔族兵士。魔族との攻防戦で右腕を失い、腕をアンドロイド・アーム化している。そのアンドロイド・アームは彼女専用の武器の真の力を発揮するトリガーにもなっている。武器に封じられている魔族の力は重力であり、その力を用いて敵をなぎ倒す。腕を失ってからの彼女の戦績は良く、更なる研究の為にと徐々に過激な戦場に赴いていく。研究の副作用で味覚が変化しているが、本人は気にしていない様子。","en":"Donna Burroughs is a United Nations Taimanin soldier. She lost her right arm in a battle against demons and now wields an android arm, which also serves as the trigger that unleashes the true power of her custom weapon. The weapon seals demonic gravity, allowing her to crush enemies with that force. Since losing her arm, her combat record has been outstanding, and she gradually takes on more extreme battlefields for further research. The side effect of the research has altered her sense of taste, but she appears unfazed."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"叶みゆき","forms":[{"id":"uni00061_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[746,1492],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[98,196],"def":[111,222],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","60009"]},{"id":"uni00061_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1092,2184],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[146,292],"def":[172,344],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","60009","60010"]},{"id":"uni00061_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1438,2875],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[194,389],"def":[233,467],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","60009","60010"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属