"variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"こちら問題なし。何か指示があるなら聞くが……そうか","en":"All clear here. If you have any orders, I'm listening... I see."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"つまらないと言われても困る。私は戦うのが仕事なんだ","en":"It's a problem if you call me boring. Fighting is my job."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"いや、疲れてなどない。ただ……気遣いは感謝する","en":"No, I'm not tired at all. Just... I appreciate the concern."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"食事か……すまない、私は味覚がちょっとおかしくなっていてな","en":"Meals, huh... sorry, my taste's a bit off right now."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"腕を失った時の事は今も覚えている。だが、だからこそこうして新しい力も手に入れられたんだ","en":"I still remember losing my arm. But that's exactly how I gained this new power."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"右腕を失ったおかげで、私は力を得た。だが私の腕を奪った魔族を許しはしない","en":"Losing my right arm gave me strength. I won't forgive the demons who took it."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"米連所属ドナ・バロウズだ、右腕のアンドロイド・アームを主兵装としている","en":"Donna Burroughs of the US forces, wielding an android arm as my main weapon."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00061_1/uni00061_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","